effects: -- the maths against crates/scene
effects: 492 of 492 crates/scene vectors within 2 per channel
effects: -- hello: capability bit 19 EFFECTS
effects: caps bit 19 1
effects: -- PLACE: a half without area is refused; a whole place is kept, nothing drawn yet
hostlink: rx D7 8F 05 00 00 01
hostlink: rx D7 8F 00 00 00 01
effects: -- a still effect (period 0): both halves taken, the left drawn once
effects: right gets breathe, 2 colours, half at 270,5 120x90, room 400x100
effects: left taken from its effect
hostlink: rx D7 8F 00 03 04 01
effects: left draws 0-20=204060
effects: draws in 300 ms after it: 0
effects: -- idle: the half goes dark, then lit again on activity
effects: left draws black
effects: left draws 0-20=204060
effects: -- a moving scanline: a frame every 33 ms, on the clock it was sent with
effects: right gets scanline, 2 colours, half at 270,5 120x90, room 400x100
hostlink: rx D7 8F 00 03 01 01
effects: draws in 330 ms: one a frame
effects: clock 335 ms after it read 500: within a frame of 835
effects: -- an endpoint change: the effect stays (nothing is streamed)
effects: draws in 330 ms after it: still drawing
effects: -- PLACE while it runs: the right gets its new place, the clock goes on
effects: right gets scanline, 2 colours, half at 300,10 120x90, room 500x120
hostlink: rx D7 8F 00 03 01 01
effects: the clock went on through it: yes
effects: -- SET_FRAME takes the lights: the effect stops on both halves, the frame draws
effects: right effect stops (frames take it)
effects: left draws 0=FF0000
effects: right frames on
hostlink: rx D7 8C 00 03 03 01
effects: draws in 300 ms after it: 0
effects: -- RELEASE of an effect that frames replaced: no change, owner none
hostlink: rx D7 8F 00 00 00 01
effects: -- an effect takes the lights from the frames, quietly (no D7 8C event)
effects: left back to its effect
effects: right frames off
effects: right gets sweep, 3 colours, half at 300,10 120x90, room 500x120
effects: left taken from its effect
hostlink: rx D7 8F 00 03 02 01
effects: the left shows the sweep at its lamps' places: yes
